"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)-8rz1x":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilitydroppoint(_:description:isenabled:)-8rz1x","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)-8rz1x","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityDropPoint","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9UnitPointV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"description","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEnabled",